    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies in relation to a delegation if: (a) the delegation was made under section 44AAH of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 before the commencement day; and (b) the delegation is in force immediately before the commencement day. (2) The delegation continues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after the commencement day, as if it were a delegation made under section 44AAH of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, as amended by the amending Act." ;
