concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-australian-energy-regulator-separation-act-2025-sch-2-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Transfer of documents to the AER"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies to a document if: (a) immediately before the commencement day, the document was in the possession of the Commission; and (b) the document was: (i) given to or received by the Commission; or (ii) brought into existence; in relation to the performance of a function of the AER under Division 3 of Part IIIAA of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. (2) The documents may be transferred to the AER on or after the commencement day. Note: Any documents transferred are Commonwealth records for the purposes of the Archives Act 1983." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies to a document if: (a) immediately before the commencement day, the document was in the possession of the Commission; and (b) the document was: (i) given to or received by the Commission; or (ii) brought into existence; in relation to the performance of a function of the AER under Division 3 of Part IIIAA of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. (2) The documents may be transferred to the AER on or after the commencement day. Note: Any documents transferred are Commonwealth records for the purposes of the Archives Act 1983."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8faa14f61f4e89483c2dcf3726ec4df3fccdbf2be8cc8e70fc15a88dbff74cfb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Transfer of documents to the AER is obligatory for documents in certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
